<br>
Cindy Wang is a first-year student at Duke University studying Neuroscience with minors in Dance and Linguistics. She is interested in the Diao Lab’s research in Regeneration Genomics and is excited to contribute to ongoing projects while gaining hands-on research experience, strengthening her scientific foundation, and learning new laboratory techniques.
